## Context budget

Conversation history usually dominates the window. Prefer a **new chat** when the phase changes (`/sc-discuss` → `/sc-run` → `/sc-ship`). Do not continue a long discuss thread into AFK run. Hand off with the one-line next action only.

## Lane Detection

| User intent | Lane |
|-------------|------|
| Ask, tell, talk, consult, research, explain, how-to, brainstorm, decide, clarify | Advisory → `/sc-discuss` when mission-scoped |
| Add, build, create, implement, develop, feature, make | Mission → `/sc-run` after discuss clear |
| Fix, debug, diagnose, broken, error, bug, crash, investigate | Debug |
| Edit prompt, config, doc, small fix, human already made changes, just commit | Quick |

| User intent | Cursor mode / action |
|---|---|
| Ask / clarify / visual draft | Agent + `/sc-discuss` |
| Roadmap implement | Agent + `/sc-run` (after discuss clear) |
| Bug hunt | Cursor Debug Mode |
| Ship | Agent + `/sc-ship` |
| Small edit / commit | Agent + `/sc-quick` |

Prefer new session on phase change (discuss → run → ship). No non-blocking questions mid-AFK. Detail skills: `sc-discuss`, `sc-run`, `sc-ship`, `sc-quick`, `sc-mission`.

## Lifecycle

```
/sc-discuss (HIL clear) → new session /sc-run → human check → /sc-ship
```

- **Discuss** → `clarify-status clear`. Handoff: `Spec clear. New session: /sc-run.`
- **Run** → plan → build → drain → review + `sc-judge` → `ready`. Handoff: `Ready. Human check, then /sc-ship.`
- **Ship** → squash ≤5, closeout, merge `--no-ff`, archive. Roadmap continues: `Next: new session → /sc-discuss <id>`

Issues policy: **sc-learn**; drain: **sc-run**. Trust ledger: `.space/trust/lessons.md`. Roadmap CLI: `spacecraft map use|current|next`.

## Sizing / roadmap (hard Must)

≤7 jigsaw tasks per phase. Over that: same-mission `plan-phaseN.json` (`Sizing: phases`) or multi-mission via discuss mission-sizing (`*-data` → `*-functional` → `*-ui` → optional `*-integrate`). Planning must not `map new` - stop for `/sc-discuss` resize. Full protocol: `sc-discuss/references/mission-sizing.md`.

## Mission resolution

Branch `feat/<id>/…` → `.space/missions/<id>/`. Clarify: `open` | `clear` | `deferred`. CLI: `evidence`/`evi`, `validate`/`val`, `roadmap`/`map`, `set-state`.

## Lanes (pointers)

- **Discuss:** sizing, lens, spec, decisions, visual draft, mission brief. Skills: `sc-clarify`, `sc-ux-design`, `sc-storm` (Tier 3 research only).
- **Mission:** plan → build → drain → review → ready. Skills: `sc-planning`, `sc-tdd`, `sc-verification`, `sc-learn`, `sc-judge` (ready only on `VERIFIED`).
- **Ship / Quick / Debug:** see matching slash skill. Quick skips mission ceremony but not INTENT / AUTH / TWINS / 3-cycle.

## Subagent Delegation

Orchestrator, not implementer. Task: `sc-coder`, `sc-tester`, `sc-planner`, `sc-reviewer` (+ `sc-judge` before ready), `sc-designer`, `sc-adviser`, `sc-firmware`, `sc-writer`.

Patterns: draft approved in discuss before run; run ports look (draft-parity); tester before coder; writer for docs/prose triage skips; ready only on `VERIFIED`.

## Graph vs Loop

`/sc-run` and `/sc-ship` are a **graph** (disk state + machine-checkable edges). Keep **loops** for discuss research, Debug, `sc-storm`, and `/sc-quick` one-offs.

## Inner-loop (Quick + Mission)

Also `000-spacecraft`. TWINS: after defect fixes, project-wide search for the same construct before claiming done. After **3 failed fix-verify cycles**, stop and hand back to human.

## Session Handoff

State, blockers, dirty git, next pickup. End with recommended next action.
